<title>ESTONIA: C.BANK FIXINGS FOR JULY 1/2.</title>
<headline>C.BANK FIXINGS FOR JULY 1/2.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank on Tuesday set</p>
<p>the following exchange rates for July 1/2. The kroon is</p>
<p>pegged at eight kroons to a German mark.</p>
<p>		  July 1/2	June 30/July 1</p>
<p>    CZK	 0.43133	 0.43006</p>
<p>    DKK	 2.10144	 2.10058</p>
<p>    FIM	 2.68585	 2.6816</p>
<p>    GBP	23.21209	23.13626</p>
<p>    HUF	 0.0745	  0.07444</p>
<p>    LTL	 3.49224	 3.47808</p>
<p>    LVL	24.40112	24.34719</p>
<p>    RUR	 0.00242	 0.00241</p>
<p>    SEK	 1.8044	  1.80231</p>
<p>    UAH	 7.51632	 7.48424</p>
<p>    USD	13.9672	 13.9132</p>
<p>    XEU	15.72078	15.70731</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202/1, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
